---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Write findings of a stress run as regression request files for `rustman run`

Usage: rustman stress export [OPTIONS] --findings <IDS> --into <DIR> <ID>

Arguments:
  <ID>
          The stress run id, str-<date>-<hex> (printed at the end of the run)

Options:
      --findings <IDS>
          Finding ids from the report (f001,f002) or `all`

      --into <DIR>
          The folder to write the files into (created if needed)

      --env <NAME>
          Environment (default: RUSTMAN_ENV, then default_environment)

      --workspace <DIR>
          Workspace directory (default: search from the current directory upwards)

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
